the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/articles-of-association.ruml".

Articles of association notarised holds for a case if
    the answer to Articles of association notarised for the case is true.

% Until a person answers, RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Articles of association notarised holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the answer to Articles of association notarised for the case is a truth value
    and Articles of association notarised would hold for the case.

